Aho ina-tae: ['html'] mahia: { <- (
		whaiaro
		whakakapihia: ['&'] me: ['&amp;'],
		whakakapihia: ['<'] me: ['&lt;'],
		whakakapihia: ['>'] me: ['&gt;'],
		whakakapihia: ['"'] me: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Rārangi hou.

['Verbatim Syntax'] pūāhua ia: { :tau :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (tau), Letter: letter).
}.

Huaputa list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list honoa: ['↵']).

Huaputa tuhi: template.

